03:03.376 --> 03:06.985
All right, we'll go ahead and get started. Welcome everybody to the work session,

03:07.001 --> 03:10.561
the Eagle Mountain City Council meeting, October 6th. It's 4

03:10.609 --> 03:15.099
o'clock and we'll go ahead and get started. The first item on our agenda

03:16.206 --> 03:19.750
