04:21.957 --> 04:25.330
a lot of questions. So we're happy to, happy to be here for you

04:25.866 --> 04:30.235
and answer any questions that you have. So with the

04:30.735 --> 04:33.551
slide— oh,

04:35.000 --> 04:38.429
here it is. Sorry, I didn't realize it was

04:38.430 --> 04:41.699
