52:59.979 --> 53:02.847
I don't think UFA I think UFA does, but I, I'm not sure. But you

53:03.347 --> 53:06.608
do have a chaplain? I'm pretty sure UFA

53:07.108 --> 53:10.173
does as well, as far as I know. Yeah, yeah, I think— and I

53:10.673 --> 53:13.531
