01:02:23.614 --> 01:02:26.430
are higher than short-term rates. So as we look to invest in things out to

01:02:26.930 --> 01:02:30.477
the 5-year for your portfolio, we're able to get a higher rate in

01:02:30.493 --> 01:02:33.121
today's current environment. So really benefiting there.

01:02:37.033 --> 01:02:41.387
I can skip over this. This essentially shows kind of the Essentially

01:02:41.403 --> 01:02:44.603
cash, which would be the orange line, or the Fed funds rate versus the 2-year

01:02:44.732 --> 01:02:48.353
