01:07:37.899 --> 01:07:39.906
Really, at the end of the day, it's good for a city to have a

01:07:40.406 --> 01:07:43.968
healthy size of cash reserves, especially a city

01:07:43.984 --> 01:07:47.837
like Eagle Mountain considering you've had pretty, I'd argue, explosive growth

01:07:48.337 --> 01:07:52.107
over the last 10 years. Having healthy reserves to compete

01:07:52.607 --> 01:07:56.507
or to keep up with that Essentially helps the taxpayer today,

01:07:56.523 --> 01:08:00.104
but also helps the taxpayer tomorrow. With that as well,

01:08:00.682 --> 01:08:04.969
the reason why you invest in a portfolio with Meader, as— sorry,

01:08:05.017 --> 01:08:07.907
what was your last name? Hewish. Hewish. As Councilmember Hewish said,

