01:08:16.130 --> 01:08:19.707
for keeping a little bit with investment firms like Meader is that METER

01:08:20.207 --> 01:08:23.777
is a little bit more strategic and can tailor investment solutions to the city.

01:08:24.274 --> 01:08:27.864
Now, METER does have to follow the Utah Money Management Act, which requires

01:08:27.960 --> 01:08:31.822
