You mentioned the ability to ladder portfolios. So going back to Ben's

01:18:02.737 --> 01:18:06.420
comments, as we have— as we take out a bond, for example,

01:18:06.436 --> 01:18:09.683
for the sewer, which is going to be a pretty big project, I don't imagine—

