does that all get funded at once? When we sell the

01:18:14.328 --> 01:18:18.292
bond portfolio, we've got $250 million to figure out how

01:18:18.792 --> 01:18:22.549
to build a bond duration in our portfolio. It's gonna be a sizable

01:18:23.049 --> 01:18:26.468
amount. Am I stating that correctly? I was gonna say,

01:18:26.564 --> 01:18:30.034
