02:11:28.582 --> 02:11:31.376
you can always come back. The road goes both ways.

02:11:32.275 --> 02:11:35.904
Uh, also our guys from UFA, and you

02:11:36.404 --> 02:11:38.553
guys made it over here but you didn't hear Chief Perchette, just left. And,

02:11:39.420 --> 02:11:42.086
you know, it's always fun working with those guys and kind of seeing what the

02:11:42.586 --> 02:11:46.758
actual numbers are. And that just our partnership with UFA

02:11:46.806 --> 02:11:50.178
in general has been over the last 15

02:11:50.259 --> 02:11:53.663
years has been amazing. And we've had great, great medical care

02:11:53.727 --> 02:11:57.002
and fire safety, and, and these guys are always here to

02:11:57.502 --> 02:12:00.920
help us. So, you know, it's— I just want to make sure that everybody knows

02:12:01.017 --> 02:12:04.260
that I love and respect UFA. And they're

02:12:04.404 --> 02:12:08.304
a great partner in our city, and we appreciate them always being

02:12:08.336 --> 02:12:11.850
with us. Also, as mentioned before, it's our

02:12:12.350 --> 02:12:14.289
last farmers market. I got to spend a lot of time there this year.

02:12:14.434 --> 02:12:17.547
I've tried to be there as much as I can and answer questions and bump

02:12:18.047 --> 02:12:20.933
into people. It's been a really good time. So make sure you make it to

02:12:21.433 --> 02:12:24.335
the farmers market and our library that was mentioned earlier in the meeting.

02:12:24.448 --> 02:12:28.123
They, they continue to get awards in this little teeny

02:12:28.171 --> 02:12:31.991
tiny thing over here compared to some of the others. They're killing it, knocking it

02:12:32.491 --> 02:12:35.170
