Yes. Councilmember Herish.

02:18:17.879 --> 02:18:20.037
Yes. Councilmember Clark. Yes.

02:18:20.231 --> 02:18:23.745
Councilmember Wright. No. Councilmember Whiting.

02:18:24.167 --> 02:18:27.633
