so, uh, public hearing, uh, Eagle Mountain City amending

04:16:10.878 --> 04:16:14.753
the municipal Code 1725.040 residential

04:16:15.253 --> 04:16:19.345
standards table. Mayor, council, we talked about this before.

04:16:19.490 --> 04:16:23.183
Scenic Mountain, remember, was just recently rezoned. We had about 223

04:16:23.683 --> 04:16:26.218
lots out there that were part of that action. This is one of the exhibits

04:16:26.718 --> 04:16:30.103
from that, that effort. In so doing, we talked

04:16:30.603 --> 04:16:33.989
about the concern that staff had, which was that in trying

04:16:34.021 --> 04:16:37.377
to assign a zone on our books to the

04:16:37.877 --> 04:16:41.215
properties out there that best matched the configurations, the sizes,

04:16:41.311 --> 04:16:44.795
etc., existing conditions of those properties, it was

04:16:45.295 --> 04:16:47.958
revealed that a number of them were below even our RC zone in sizing,

04:16:48.376 --> 04:16:51.828
which bottoms out at 4,500 square feet. So a lot of those were about 3,800

04:16:52.328 --> 04:16:56.179
and change. To further the effort of trying to keep

04:16:56.679 --> 04:17:00.932
from having issues with those properties questioned down the road by the private sector

04:17:01.237 --> 04:17:04.850
as to whether they were legally conforming or not, et cetera, and then force

04:17:05.350 --> 04:17:08.912
us into generating zoning verification letters, potentially rebuild letters

04:17:08.944 --> 04:17:12.204
at the time of a financial transaction by any of the parties in

04:17:12.220 --> 04:17:15.945
that Scenic Mountain project. We discussed

04:17:16.445 --> 04:17:19.991
and it seemed agreeable to have the proposed zoning code amendment, which is

04:17:20.344 --> 04:17:24.037
before you right now in red underneath the chart.

04:17:24.439 --> 04:17:27.859
And it simply says that for not new properties,

04:17:28.373 --> 04:17:32.002
Nothing newly developed, but for those existing properties, if they happen to be under 4,500

04:17:32.502 --> 04:17:36.000
square feet and/or have a setback configuration that was substandard per our code

04:17:36.500 --> 04:17:40.287
in some fashion, that we would recognize those as legally conforming,

04:17:40.399 --> 04:17:42.759
not nonconforming, but conforming. So in other words, we're giving them a buy.

04:17:44.108 --> 04:17:47.464
And this same approach you may see, if you're agreeable with it,

04:17:47.480 --> 04:17:51.944
down the road, but it's again to try and unobstruct people's

04:17:52.201 --> 04:17:54.894
financial transactions with properties. properties that are already built out.

04:18:00.110 --> 04:18:03.492
Any questions? Seeing none, this is

04:18:03.992 --> 04:18:07.496
also a public hearing. At 9:44, we will open the public

04:18:07.996 --> 04:18:11.337
hearing and find out if anyone came for this. Not a soul.

