Whiting. I'd like to make a motion. I move

04:18:26.772 --> 04:18:30.130
that the City Council approve Agenda Item 15E, an ordinance of

04:18:30.630 --> 04:18:35.673
Eagle Mountain City, Utah, amending the Eagle Mountain Municipal Code Section 17.25.040

04:18:35.785 --> 04:18:38.806
Residential Standards Table. Second. Okay,

04:18:38.903 --> 04:18:42.160
we have a motion by Councilmember Whiting, a second by Councilmember Hewish,

04:18:43.015 --> 04:18:45.291
and we will start the vote with Councilmember Clark. Yes.

04:18:45.533 --> 04:18:48.984
Councilmember Wright. Yes. Council Member Whiting? Yes. Council Member Wood?

04:18:49.241 --> 04:18:51.790
Yes. And Council Member Hirsch? Yes.

